WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:24.682
"It's springtime!" shouted Mole.

2
00:00:24.683 --> 00:00:26.825
"Smell that fresh air!

3
00:00:26.826 --> 00:00:31.602
But my house is so dusty and dirty," he said.

4
00:00:31.603 --> 00:00:33.323
"I need a bucket.

5
00:00:33.324 --> 00:00:34.809
I need a mop.

6
00:00:34.810 --> 00:00:37.812
It's time to clean!"

7
00:00:37.813 --> 00:00:41.610
He stood on a ladder to dust a bookcase.

8
00:00:41.611 --> 00:00:44.667
He moved a chair to clean under it.

9
00:00:44.668 --> 00:00:49.029
He even polished the doorknobs!

10
00:00:49.030 --> 00:00:52.003
"The kitchen is spotless!

11
00:00:52.004 --> 00:00:55.086
The pots and pans are all washed.

12
00:00:55.087 --> 00:00:58.623
The floor is next," said Mole.

13
00:00:58.624 --> 00:01:03.406
Back and forth Mole scrubbed the floor.

14
00:01:03.407 --> 00:01:06.904
"Ow!" he groaned.

15
00:01:06.905 --> 00:01:08.898
"My back is sore.

16
00:01:08.899 --> 00:01:11.909
My arms are sore too."

17
00:01:11.910 --> 00:01:15.214
Mole threw the scrub brush down.

18
00:01:15.215 --> 00:01:18.379
"Forget it!" he said.

19
00:01:18.380 --> 00:01:21.011
Mole grabbed his blue coat.

20
00:01:21.012 --> 00:01:24.880
He ran up a tunnel to the outside.

21
00:01:24.881 --> 00:01:28.945
"Up we go! Up we go!"

22
00:01:28.946 --> 00:01:31.964
Mole's head popped out of his hole.

23
00:01:31.965 --> 00:01:35.987
"Wow, the sun is bright!"

24
00:01:35.988 --> 00:01:38.160
Mole jumped out.

25
00:01:38.161 --> 00:01:42.145
"The grass smells sweet," he said.

26
00:01:42.146 --> 00:01:44.758
He rolled in the grass.

27
00:01:44.759 --> 00:01:47.145
He chased the butterflies.

28
00:01:47.146 --> 00:01:52.433
"This is so much better than cleaning!" said Mole.

29
00:01:52.434 --> 00:01:55.023
He ran across the meadow.

30
00:01:55.024 --> 00:01:58.626
"Stop!" yelled an old rabbit.

31
00:01:58.627 --> 00:02:03.380
"You must pay six pennies to run through here!"
